title: $:/language/hypergsd/Settings/

# Contexts additions to the shared Settings string namespace (same key space
# as the main plugin; the sub-plugin owns only these keys).
Pages/Context/Caption: Context page
Lists/ContextProjects/Caption: Projects list
Lists/ContextProjects/Hint: Projects tagged with this context, completed ones last
Fragments/Contextualise/Caption: Contextualise button
Fragments/Contextualise/Hint: A button that lets you apply contexts, plus pills for each tagged context
Fragments/Contextualise/ShowApplied: Show tagged contexts with links